@startuml
title Valetax Support Ticket Co-Pilot - System Context
left to right direction
actor Customer
actor "Support Agent / Human Reviewer" as Agent
actor "Support Operations / Compliance" as Ops
rectangle "Support Ticket Co-Pilot\n(agent-assist only)" as Copilot
cloud "Approved Valetax Pages" as KB <<external untrusted content>>
cloud "Optional LLM Provider" as LLM <<external processor>>
database "Evaluation and Business-case Outputs" as Reports

Customer --> Agent : support ticket
Agent --> Copilot : submit ticket
Copilot --> Agent : structured classification,\ncited draft or abstention,\nhuman-review reason
Ops --> Copilot : policy, thresholds, review
Copilot --> KB : allowlisted snapshot fetch
Copilot --> LLM : minimized constrained request
Copilot --> Reports : redacted measurements

note bottom of Copilot
No transactions, customer sending,
trading advice, or complaint/KYC/AML decisions.
end note
@enduml
